a0c.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=480&w=640","width":640,"height":480},"800x600":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1701366/1973d07d-45c7-4e30-bda7-ed1175655a0c.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=600&w=800","width":800,"height":600}}}],"videos":null,"description":"PERFECT FOR\nCreatives, culture enthusiasts, individuals, couples, or small families who love urban living and want to be in the heart of the action. \n\nLOCATION & CHARACTER \nWelcome to Schöneberg – one of Berlin's most vibrant and culturally rich neighborhood. This wonderful 3-room apartment is located in close proximity to Potsdamer Straße, the pulsing heart of the district. Surrounded by galleries, creative cafés, excellent restaurants, and trendy bars – everything is right on your doorstep. A place where culture, creativity, and urban life are lived anew every day. \n\nPROPERTY \nBerlin Altbau charm in a well-maintained building. The apartment captivates with high ceilings, generous room proportions, and authentic period details that preserve the spirit of this era. \n\nFEATURES \n• 86 square meters of living space \n• 3 rooms \n• 1 kitchen (modern fitted) \n• 1 bathroom \n• Fully furnished and well-equipped \n• Bright, friendly rooms with natural light \n• Generous ceiling heights typical of Berlin Altbau \n• Oak parquet flooring and original stucco elements \n• Modern kitchen in a traditional setting \n\nLIVING SPACE \nThe three rooms offer flexible uses – living room, bedroom, home office, or guest room as needed. The bright living room invites you to linger and is the perfect place for convivial evenings with friends. \n\nKITCHEN & BATHROOM \nThe contemporarily equipped kitchen combines functionality with classic Altbau ambiance. The bathroom is practical and provides everything needed for daily use.","facilities":{"airConditioning":{"value":"no"},"allergyFriendly":{"value":"no"},"balconyTerrace":{"value":"private"},"basement":{"value":"no"},"bathroom"